# Files the Codex plugin package does not need at runtime. The plugin is the
# repository root: `.codex-plugin/`, `.agents/`, `hooks/`, `skills/` and
# `assets/` stay in; tests, documentation, benchmarks, generated distributions
# for other hosts, CI configuration and local state stay out.
.github/
.claude/
.click/
benchmarks/
dist/
docs/
evals/
platforms/
scripts/
tests/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
.env
.env.*
